examples
# The example images build from the repo root and copy their agent script in,
# so those two files must stay in the context (the rest of examples/ — configs,
# __pycache__, compose files — stays excluded).
!examples/openai-agents/agent.py
!examples/claude-agent-sdk/agent.py
coverage.txt
*.md
